    // Descriptions
    "Calculate your monthly mortgage payments including principal and interest, property taxes, homeowners insurance, HOA fees, and private mortgage insurance (PMI).": "Hitung perkiraan cicilan bulanan KPR rumah Anda mencakup pokok, bunga, asuransi, dan biaya pemeliharaan.",
    "Calculate monthly repayments, total interest, and compile complete amortization schedules for mortgages, auto loans, or personal loans.": "Hitung angsuran bulanan, total bunga pinjaman, dan buat tabel amortisasi lengkap untuk pinjaman bank atau multifinance.",
    "Compare two popular strategies for paying off multiple debts: the Snowball method (smallest balances first) and the Avalanche method (highest interest rates first).": "Bandingkan metode Snowball dan Avalanche untuk melunasi berbagai tagihan utang lebih cepat dan hemat bunga.",
    "Evaluate if refinancing your mortgage or loan will save you money. Compare monthly payments, lifetime interest, and calculate your exact break-even timeline.": "Analisis penghematan dari take over atau refinancing pinjaman dan temukan titik impas biaya pengalihan.",
    "Estimate your monthly student loan payments under Income-Driven Repayment (IDR) plans like SAVE, PAYE, and IBR based on your income, loan type, and family size.": "Hitung simulasi cicilan pinjaman dana pendidikan berdasarkan penghasilan dan jumlah tanggungan.",
    "Calculate your front-end DTI (housing cost ratio) and back-end DTI (total monthly debt ratio) to see if you meet standard mortgage qualifying guidelines.": "Ukur rasio beban utang terhadap penghasilan kotor untuk memastikan kesiapan pengajuan kredit perbankan.",
    "Determine the true Annual Percentage Rate (APR) of a loan by factoring in closing costs, points, and lender fees alongside the nominal interest rate.": "Ketahui suku bunga efektif tahunan sebenarnya dengan memperhitungkan biaya provisi, administrasi, dan asuransi.",
    "Compare the long-term wealth impact of buying a home versus renting and investing the difference over a 10 to 30 year horizon.": "Bandingkan pertumbuhan aset jangka panjang antara membeli rumah sendiri atau menyewa sambil menginvestasikan selisih dananya selama 10-30 tahun.",
    "Calculate how much house you can afford based on your annual income, down payment, monthly debts, and local property taxes.": "Ketahui batas maksimal harga properti yang aman dibeli sesuai kemampuan gaji, tabungan DP, dan cicilan bulanan Anda.",
    "Estimate your monthly car payments, financed amounts, and overall cost of purchasing a vehicle. Factor in sales taxes, dealer fees, and trade-in credits.": "Simulasikan cicilan kredit mobil atau motor lengkap dengan uang muka (DP), pajak, dan nilai tukar tambah kendaraan lama.",
    "Discover how long it will take to pay off your credit card balance with minimum payments versus accelerated payments, and calculate total interest savings.": "Lihat berapa lama tagihan kartu kredit lunas jika membayar batas minimum dibanding pembayaran dipercepat beserta penghematan bunganya.",
    "Calculate how much you need to save for retirement, forecast your portfolio balance at retirement age, and test sustainable withdrawal rates.": "Hitung dana pensiun yang harus dikumpulkan untuk hari tua yang nyaman dan uji tingkat penarikan dana yang aman.",
    "Simulate how your 401(k) retirement balance grows with salary deferrals and employer matching contributions.": "Simulasikan akumulasi dana pensiun dari pemotongan gaji rutin dan iuran subsidi perusahaan.",
    "Compare Traditional and Roth IRAs to determine which retirement account will maximize your net take-home wealth after accounting for current and future tax brackets.": "Bandingkan program pensiun untuk memaksimalkan akumulasi kekayaan bersih setelah pajak di masa depan.",
