    "Estimate your take-home pay after federal taxes, state taxes, FICA, and pre-tax benefit deductions.": "Hitung gaji bersih bulanan Anda setelah dipotong pajak penghasilan (PPh 21) dan iuran jaminan sosial BPJS.",
    "Estimate your net take-home pay per paycheck and annually by calculating federal, state, and FICA tax withholdings along with pre-tax and post-tax deductions.": "Rincian kalkulasi penghasilan bersih per periode penggajian dan tahunan.",
